Broader Mage Sight</a></b> - How to make meeting new people interesting.</li> <li><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/909034-2e-hack-%E2%80%93-easier-withstood-for-supernaturals\">Easier Withstood for supernaturals</a></b> - For those thinking that monsters should be a bit better in resisting mage spells</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883172-2e-hack-high-speech-runes-for-indefinite-spells\"><b>High Speech Runes for Indefinite</b> <b>spells</b> </a>- As title says, for those that want truly Lasting ( <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) spells entwined in images.</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/878180-2e-left-hand-yantras\"><b>Left Hand Yantras</b></a> - How to use general &quot;Black Arts&quot; in <b>Mage</b> game.</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883526-2e-legacies-hack-%E2%80%93-royal-arcanum\"><b>Legacies - Royal Arcanum</b></a> - Alternative solution to &quot;Double Ruling Arcanum&quot; problem for those do not liking Experience refund option.</li> <li><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1192542-2e-mages-development-by-age\">Mages development by age</a></b> - Rise Awakened Traits by spent time, not XP.</li> <li><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/918971-2e-hack-more-individualistic-souls-%E2%80%93-or-why-souls-are-made-of-5-subtle-arcana\"><b>More individualistic souls</b></a> - Or why souls are made of Five Subtle Arcana</li> <li><b><a href=\