r/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-11T01:34:05-07:00","id":1317760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883141-wyrd-s-mage-2e-hacks-hub?p=1317707#post1317707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you done any hacks for the Nimbus ? At the moment its not likely to be used for more than to add the occasional stylistic flare to a scene.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking about something about two years ago - but did not get anywhere with it. As I now pass much more into other gamelines, I will probably not return to Mage Hacks before Signs of Sorcery ( to check what is official and what is not ).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883141-wyrd-s-mage-2e-hacks-hub?p=1317707#post1317707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On an unrelated note, any chance you could try updating the Imagineers ?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not good on Legacy updates to 2E. There is semi-official topic on updates run by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a> - ask him for update, maybe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-19T16:02:54-07:00","id":1319589,"title":"","content":"Can I run a hack by people with a head for game mechanics (i.e., not me)? I want magic to be more dangerous, scary, unpredictable, and generally a pain in the ass, but I don't want to complicate the rules much. My first thought was just to flat-out eliminate any and all free Reach; if you Reach, you gain paradox, full stop. But I don't know what kind of knock-on effects that might have overall, because, again, no head for mechanics.<br /> <br /> I was thinking of being relatively merciful and allowing a free reach for your greater arcanum, but charging mana for every improvised spell, but I'm planning on going with a &quot;Just pick a greater and lesser arcana of your choice that reflects your character, don't worry too much about Path&quot; hack anyway so it's not really that big a deal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":543,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","user":"Professor Phobos","date":". 06-19-2019, 07:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-19T23:53:35-07:00","id":1319644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Professor Phobos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/883141-wyrd-s-mage-2e-hacks-hub?p=1319589#post1319589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can I run a hack by people with a head for game mechanics (i.e., not me)? I want magic to be more dangerous, scary, unpredictable, and generally a pain in the ass, but I don't want to complicate the rules much. My first thought was just to flat-out eliminate any and all free Reach; if you Reach, you gain paradox, full stop. But I don't know what kind of knock-on effects that might have overall, because, again, no head for mechanics.<br /> <br /> I was thinking of being relatively merciful and allowing a free reach for your greater arcanum, but charging mana for every improvised spell, but I'm planning on going with a &quot;Just pick a greater and lesser arcana of your choice that reflects your character, don't worry too much about Path&quot; hack anyway so it's not really that big a deal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really the right thread for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}